{"2840000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lumina Veil", "steam_appid": 2840000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.mp4?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are LunatiiCreeps, a horror-loving streamer known for braving the darkest corners of the gaming world. You get exclusive access to this new strange game and decide to embark on a journey into the shadows of the mind with Lumina Veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.mp4?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic horror with a modern twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating horror experience that blurs the line between reality and nightmare. Solve puzzles, survive terrifying monstrosities, and use any tool necessary to fight for your life. Inspired by the horror classics, Lumina Veil offers an old school atmosphere with modern themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/22cccbcb4bb824e15fd8a6f213b72974.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/22cccbcb4bb824e15fd8a6f213b72974.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/22cccbcb4bb824e15fd8a6f213b72974.mp4?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A double life</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While exploring your new game as a streamer, you also live your real life, where the facade of normalcy masks a society grappling with isolation and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Completely free solo project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lumina Veil will be a free game with zero monetization, developed by one person, aiming to give a nod to the classics.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/209b12a15a0f6802fafe21741d9d4803.mp4?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are LunatiiCreeps, a horror-loving streamer known for braving the darkest corners of the gaming world. You get exclusive access to this new strange game and decide to embark on a journey into the shadows of the mind with Lumina Veil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/df6de26a0466586a7397a393a27c47a9.mp4?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Classic horror with a modern twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A captivating horror experience that blurs the line between reality and nightmare. Solve puzzles, survive terrifying monstrosities, and use any tool necessary to fight for your life. Inspired by the horror classics, Lumina Veil offers an old school atmosphere with modern themes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/22cccbcb4bb824e15fd8a6f213b72974.poster.avif?t=1786791692\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2840000/extras/22cccbcb4bb824e15fd8a6f213b72974.webm?t=1786791692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass